    "longBusinessSummary": "Wellnet Corporation engages in the development and provision of payment processing, electronic billing, electronic payment, and mobile authentication services in Japan. The company also provides membership management services; multi-payment and money transfer services; Shimaeru, a service for concerns about electronic invoices and the electronic bookkeeping act; and Payment Secretary, a smartphone app for making payments directly from bank account. In addition, it offers Bus Mori!, an app to purchase tickets and coupons; Bus Mori! Web Ticket Collection Site, a website for receiving bus tickets; Altair Triple Star Cloud, a MaaS-type sales core system; and service information signage. Wellnet Corporation was incorporated in 1983 and is headquartered in Sapporo, Japan.",
